            <samplingProcedure xml:lang="en">Values given in the reference originate from manufacturers and/or other data sources which in turn refer to the real situation and hence are largely secured. However, the emissions of N and P into the water may be somewhat uncertain. When no information on the speciation of N- and P-emissions was given in the reference, the most likely speciation based on expert's opinion is presented. </samplingProcedure>
